{"id":"8022d02fee1d4e94","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-internalization.md","title":"thm-internalization","display":"thm-internalization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"9.5","label":"16-thm-internalization","aliases":["16-thm-internalization","16-thm--internalization"],"display":"thm-internalization","depends_on":["[[16-df-small-fibration]]","[[16-df-locally-small-fibration]]","[[16-df-generic-object]]","[[16-thm-full-internal-category]]","[[16-df-externalization]]"],"review_status":"revised-with-source","review_priority":"P1","review_note_id":"J09","review_date":"2026-10-15","source":"Definition 7.3.3; Theorem 9.5.5 and Corollary 9.5.6, pp. 423, 562–564 (PDF 443, 582–584)","revision_date":"2026-10-15","review_history":[{"date":"2026-10-07","status":"pending-definition","note_id":"J09","priority":"P1"}]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"9.5"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-internalization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-internalization</span><span>16-thm--internalization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-internalization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1c365b3f935b3add\" href=\"?note=1c365b3f935b3add\" title=\"16-df-small-fibration\">16-df-small-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2fec5704f304349d\" href=\"?note=2fec5704f304349d\" title=\"16-df-locally-small-fibration\">16-df-locally-small-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f600e95377e8cbf9\" href=\"?note=f600e95377e8cbf9\" title=\"16-df-generic-object\">16-df-generic-object</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"efccab17ee574b84\" href=\"?note=efccab17ee574b84\" title=\"16-thm-full-internal-category\">16-thm-full-internal-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e85a3cc0dff01389\" href=\"?note=e85a3cc0dff01389\" title=\"16-df-externalization\">16-df-externalization</a></span></div>"},{"key":"review_status","html":"revised-with-source"},{"key":"review_priority","html":"P1"},{"key":"review_note_id","html":"J09"},{"key":"review_date","html":"2026-10-15"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 7.3.3; Theorem 9.5.5 and Corollary 9.5.6, pp. 423, 562–564 (PDF 443, 582–584)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-15"},{"key":"review_history","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><div class=\"property-object\"><div><span class=\"property-key\">date：</span>2026-10-07</div><div><span class=\"property-key\">status：</span>pending-definition</div><div><span class=\"property-key\">note_id：</span>J09</div><div><span class=\"property-key\">priority：</span>P1</div></div></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定足够大的 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal W\">\\(\\mathcal W\\)</span>，所用范畴在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal W\">\\(\\mathcal W\\)</span> 中小并以集合元组编码；假定其中的选择公理，以便从纤维上满忠实且本质满的函子构造同基底准逆。下述 small 始终指相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 的小性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 有有限极限，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 带指定分裂 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\">\\(U\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为任意对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=pU\">\\(A=pU\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi^{\\mathbb C}_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\pi^{\\mathbb C}_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 是外部化总范畴到基范畴的投影；它与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Small}_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\mathrm{Small}_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmallSplitFib}_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\mathrm{SmallSplitFib}_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibEq}_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibEq}_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1c365b3f935b3add\" href=\"?note=1c365b3f935b3add\" title=\"16-df-small-fibration\">16-df-small-fibration</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocalSmall}(p,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{LocalSmall}(p,\\kappa)\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2fec5704f304349d\" href=\"?note=2fec5704f304349d\" title=\"16-df-locally-small-fibration\">16-df-locally-small-fibration</a> 的垂直态射可表示性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakGeneric}_p\">\\(\\mathrm{WeakGeneric}_p\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}_p\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}_p\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f600e95377e8cbf9\" href=\"?note=f600e95377e8cbf9\" title=\"16-df-generic-object\">16-df-generic-object</a> 的不同量词条件；前者只要求存在分类基箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Full}_{p,\\kappa}(U)\">\\(\\operatorname{Full}_{p,\\kappa}(U)\\)</span> 及其函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_U\">\\(\\Phi_U\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"efccab17ee574b84\" href=\"?note=efccab17ee574b84\" title=\"16-thm-full-internal-category\">16-thm-full-internal-category</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmallSplitFib}_{\\mathcal B}(p,\\kappa)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LocalSmall}(p,\\kappa)\n\\land(\\exists U\\in\\mathcal E)\\mathrm{WeakGeneric}_p(U),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LocalSmall}(p,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{WeakGeneric}_p(U)\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FibEq}_{\\mathcal B}\\bigl(p,\n\\pi^{\\operatorname{Full}_{p,\\kappa}(U)}_{\\mathcal B}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LocalSmall}(p,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Generic}_p(U)\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Small}_{\\mathcal B}(p).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmallSplitFib}_{\\mathcal B}(p,\\kappa)\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LocalSmall}(p,\\kappa)\n\\land(\\exists U\\in\\mathcal E)\\mathrm{WeakGeneric}_p(U),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LocalSmall}(p,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{WeakGeneric}_p(U)\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FibEq}_{\\mathcal B}\\bigl(p,\n\\pi^{\\operatorname{Full}_{p,\\kappa}(U)}_{\\mathcal B}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LocalSmall}(p,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Generic}_p(U)\n&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Small}_{\\mathcal B}(p).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>充分性：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_U\">\\(\\Phi_U\\)</span> 满且忠实；弱泛性给每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal E_I\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal E_I\\)</span> 一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to pU\">\\(u:I\\to pU\\)</span> 和垂直同构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\cong u^*U\">\\(X\\cong u^*U\\)</span>，故它在每个纤维本质满，并给出同基底纤维等价。此证明不使用分类箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的唯一性。</li>\n<li>必要性：内部范畴外部化具有由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}_{C_0}\">\\(\\operatorname{id}_{C_0}\\)</span> 给出的分裂泛对象，因此具有弱泛对象。其局部 hom 代表由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s,t):C_1\\to C_0\\times C_0\">\\((s,t):C_1\\to C_0\\times C_0\\)</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle:I\\to C_0\\times C_0\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle:I\\to C_0\\times C_0\\)</span> 的拉回给出；拉回的泛箭头对应外部化的垂直箭头。弱泛性与此可表示性均沿同基底纤维等价转移。</li>\n<li>原书 Corollary 9.5.6 用 generic 一词；Definition 5.2.8 区分 weak、ordinary、strong，而 Lemma 7.3.2 明确给外部化提供 split generic。本页陈述证明实际需要的存在性版本，并保留 ordinary generic 的充分性推论，不将 split generic 自动等同于“按垂直同构唯一分类”的 ordinary generic。即使分类基箭头不唯一，满忠实且本质满的构造仍有效。</li>\n<li>本页替换原 J09 中仅将 SmallSplitFib 称为“内部可表示”再重述该性质的循环接口。局部小性、弱泛性及内部对象/箭头构造均已由本书目录内的原子给出；原 2026-10-07 待完成记录保存在元数据历史及旧修订报告中。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs，Definition 7.3.3，印刷 p. 423 / PDF p. 443；Theorem 9.5.5、Corollary 9.5.6 及证明，印刷 pp. 562–564 / PDF pp. 582–584。本轮核对构造与证明所用量词，给出上述弱泛版本的本地论证；未进行机器证明。逐纤维小的预层内部化另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"fe8616bdebd0be49\" href=\"?note=fe8616bdebd0be49\" title=\"16-thm-presheaf-internalization\">16-thm-presheaf-internalization</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-small-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"1c365b3f935b3add","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-small-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-locally-small-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"2fec5704f304349d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-locally-small-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-generic-object","status":"resolved","id":"f600e95377e8cbf9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-generic-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-full-internal-category","status":"resolved","id":"efccab17ee574b84","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-full-internal-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-externalization","status":"resolved","id":"e85a3cc0dff01389","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-externalization]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-small-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"1c365b3f935b3add","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\pi^{\\mathbb C}_{\\mathcal B}$ 是外部化总范畴到基范畴的投影；它与 $\\mathrm{Small}_{\\mathcal B}$、$\\mathrm{SmallSplitFib}_{\\mathcal B}$、$\\mathrm{FibEq}_{\\mathcal B}$ 见 [[16-df-small-fibration]]；$\\mathrm{LocalSmall}(p,\\kappa)$ 是 [[16-df-locally-small-fibration]] 的垂直态射可表示性。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-locally-small-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"2fec5704f304349d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\pi^{\\mathbb C}_{\\mathcal B}$ 是外部化总范畴到基范畴的投影；它与 $\\mathrm{Small}_{\\mathcal B}$、$\\mathrm{SmallSplitFib}_{\\mathcal B}$、$\\mathrm{FibEq}_{\\mathcal B}$ 见 [[16-df-small-fibration]]；$\\mathrm{LocalSmall}(p,\\kappa)$ 是 [[16-df-locally-small-fibration]] 的垂直态射可表示性。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-generic-object","status":"resolved","id":"f600e95377e8cbf9","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WeakGeneric}_p$ 与 $\\mathrm{Generic}_p$ 采用 [[16-df-generic-object]] 的不同量词条件；前者只要求存在分类基箭头。$\\operatorname{Full}_{p,\\kappa}(U)$ 及其函子 $\\Phi_U$ 见 [[16-thm-full-internal-category]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-full-internal-category","status":"resolved","id":"efccab17ee574b84","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WeakGeneric}_p$ 与 $\\mathrm{Generic}_p$ 采用 [[16-df-generic-object]] 的不同量词条件；前者只要求存在分类基箭头。$\\operatorname{Full}_{p,\\kappa}(U)$ 及其函子 $\\Phi_U$ 见 [[16-thm-full-internal-category]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-presheaf-internalization","status":"resolved","id":"fe8616bdebd0be49","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Jacobs，Definition 7.3.3，印刷 p. 423 / PDF p. 443；Theorem 9.5.5、Corollary 9.5.6 及证明，印刷 pp. 562–564 / PDF pp. 582–584。本轮核对构造与证明所用量词，给出上述弱泛版本的本地论证；未进行机器证明。逐纤维小的预层内部化另见 [[16-thm-presheaf-internalization]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"U\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"A=pU","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi^{\\mathbb C}_{\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Small}_{\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmallSplitFib}_{\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibEq}_{\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LocalSmall}(p,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeakGeneric}_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Full}_{p,\\kappa}(U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_U","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SmallSplitFib}_{\\mathcal B}(p,\\kappa)\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{LocalSmall}(p,\\kappa)\n\\land(\\exists U\\in\\mathcal E)\\mathrm{WeakGeneric}_p(U),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LocalSmall}(p,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{WeakGeneric}_p(U)\n&\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{FibEq}_{\\mathcal B}\\bigl(p,\n\\pi^{\\operatorname{Full}_{p,\\kappa}(U)}_{\\mathcal B}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{LocalSmall}(p,\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Generic}_p(U)\n&\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Small}_{\\mathcal B}(p).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi_U","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathcal E_I","display":false},{"tex":"u:I\\to pU","display":false},{"tex":"X\\cong u^*U","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{id}_{C_0}","display":false},{"tex":"(s,t):C_1\\to C_0\\times C_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,y\\rangle:I\\to C_0\\times C_0","display":false}],"bytes":3908,"backlinks":[{"id":"1c365b3f935b3add","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"Definition 7.3.3 以外部化的本质像定义 small，因此这一页的定义本身不是非循环的内部化判据；独立判据由 [[16-thm-internalization]] 给出。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-internal-category]]、[[16-df-externalization]]、[[16-df-internal-diagram]]、[[16-df-locally-small-fibration]]、[[16-df-small-fibration]]、[[16-thm-full-internal-category]]、[[16-thm-internalization]]、[[16-thm-presheaf-internalization]]、[[16-thm-extern-preserves]]。相对于原基范畴的小性与改变基底后的预层内部化分别阅读。"},{"id":"fe8616bdebd0be49","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"内部范畴位于 $\\widehat{\\mathcal B}$。本结论不将逐纤维的外部集合小性认作 [[16-thm-internalization]] 中相对于原基范畴的局部可表示性。"}],"outgoing":["1c365b3f935b3add","2fec5704f304349d","f600e95377e8cbf9","efccab17ee574b84","e85a3cc0dff01389","fe8616bdebd0be49"]}